			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">(4)</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;">The business address of Hudson Global Ventures, LLC is 1 Linden Pl., Suite 210, Great Neck, NY 11021[&#9679;]. [Sepas Ahdoot and Soheil Ahdoot are the joint- owners of Hudson Global Ventures, LLC (&#8220;Hudson&#8221;) and have the voting control and investment discretion over the securities reported herein that are held by Hudson. As a result, Sepas Ahdoot and Soheil Ahdoot may be deemed to have beneficial ownership (as determined under Section 13(d) of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, as amended (the &#8220;Exchange Act&#8221;) of the securities reported herein that are held by Hudson.]</p>
